==English==

===Pronunciation===
*: Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɔːz|-ɔːz]]

===Etymology===
probably from obsolete [[taw]] 'tawsed leather'

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|mostly|Scottish English}} A sturdy [[leather]] [[strap]] which is split into (typically about three) tails, used for [[flog]]ging as a [[corporal punishment]], mainly for [[children]] on hand or bottom.
:Confusingly also informally denoted as 'strap' or even '[[belt]]'

